WEBVTT

00:00:06.098 --> 00:00:06.823
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:07.918 --> 00:00:11.044
<v><b>F:</b></v> We’re all stressed because we’re working to a tight schedule.

00:00:13.137 --> 00:00:13.857
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.959 --> 00:00:17.731
<v><b>F:</b></v> There’s space for three cars in their garage.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:20.730
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:24.154
<v><b>M:</b></v> I only just had time to grab a sandwich.

00:00:26.131 --> 00:00:26.852
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:27.874 --> 00:00:32.194
<v><b>M:</b></v> I know I enjoyed the meal, but I can’t remember exactly what I ate.

00:00:34.477 --> 00:00:35.331
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.363 --> 00:00:39.118
<v><b>M:</b></v> She accused the media of harassment.

00:00:41.453 --> 00:00:42.292
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:43.526 --> 00:00:46.002
<v><b>F:</b></v> He couldn’t read the address on the envelope.

00:00:47.936 --> 00:00:48.788
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:49.998 --> 00:00:52.858
<v><b>M:</b></v> The others left the room to give us some privacy.

00:00:54.745 --> 00:00:55.467
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:59.876
<v><b>F:</b></v> Her latest novel has caused a lot of controversy.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:02.670
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:03.752 --> 00:01:06.092
<v><b>F:</b></v> I don’t tend to go to the doctor’s very often.

00:01:08.171 --> 00:01:08.931
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:09.857 --> 00:01:11.945
<v><b>F:</b></v> She looked up as I entered the room.

00:01:14.075 --> 00:01:15.019
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 11

00:01:16.166 --> 00:01:19.555
<v><b>M:</b></v> It isn’t far to the station – just over a kilometre.

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:22.288
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 12

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:27.274
<v><b>M:</b></v> The course starts tomorrow and finishes on Friday.